e comment needs updating to be accurate. I'm working through the requirements mapping more carefully. Looking at the R2 requirements, I need to account for what's actually implemented versus what's not. R2.1 and R2.8 aren't supported, so the correct range is R2.2 through R2.7, which covers the `-s`, `-a`, `-d`, `-k`, `-m`, and `-c` flags.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15431,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15431},"output_tokens":32,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a0450dfc-f741-4f95-ad55-4b9f8f2db58a","uuid":"6d2b354f-bc27-4c1c-baad-69fdde0b7651"}
